 "title": "OmniShotCut: Holistic Relational Shot Boundary Detection",
 "summary": "OmniShotCut is a transformer-based framework designed for high-precision Shot Boundary Detection across diverse video types. It uses a Shot-Query architecture to holistically identify complex transitions like dissolves, fades, and sudden jumps.",
